'''Haunted''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is currently obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2025]] by collecting 3,200 '''[[Candies (2025)|Candies]]''' {{Currency|Candies2025}} and purchasing the 4th tier, or through trading.
==Appearance==
This knife shows a night sky with bats flying about with a Haunted House featured at the bottom. It appears to be set in a forest as there a tree branches in the background.

